WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Sit with knees bent, feet flat, hands behind you.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Fingers point toward or away from the feet.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Press up until thighs and torso are parallel to the floor.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Lift the chest; head can stay neutral or gently tip back.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Hold, then sit down with control.
